{
  "id": "ss.lib.leg",
  "name": "Survivor leg",
  "description": "One leg of a survivor at five heads tall, hinged at the origin: the hip sits at [0,0] and the leg hangs down +y, so a `rot` track swings it from the hip the way a leg swings. Thigh in dark hose, a knee plate, a shin, and a boot with its toe forward (+x) and a cuff at the top — the base kit under whatever armour a survivor has found. `plate` puts a greave over the shin and a sabaton over the boot; `far` and `plate_far` are the same two legs on the other side of the body, a step darker each, so a pair reads as depth.",
